  "note": "The grip carries printed labels 30 / 40 / 35 / 39: these are the Sol-R base numbers (same controls as 7 / 17 / 12 / 16 on the AVA base). Handed: these numbers are the right-handed mode (0432). In left-handed mode (043A) the manual's left-handed figures put the POV on the LEFT hat and the 4-way buttons on the right hat, so trim hat / hat 2 swap places. The lever on the left side of the grip is not numbered in the manual (side rest), so it has no part. The quick-release ring at the bottom is not a control.",
